Task: Implement typed OrderNotFound + GET /orders/{id} route (Green)

Summary: Added sealed trait OrderError / case object OrderNotFound — the first
modeled domain error in this codebase (every prior endpoint used Unit as its tapir
error type). Added ErrorResponse(error: String) for the JSON error body. Extended
OrderResponse with status/createdAt (additive; existing fields unchanged) and gave it
an Order => OrderResponse convenience constructor. Added getOrderEndpoint (GET
/orders/{id}) with errorOut mapping OrderNotFound to a 404 + ErrorResponse via
EndpointOutput.map. Wired the new endpoint into OrderRoutes.routes and Main's
Docs.routes list (so it also gets OpenAPI/Swagger documentation for free, same as
every other purerest.docs-registered endpoint).

